  "description": "VOXHAV crystallizes in the monoclinic crystal system with space group P 21. Reported CIF formula moiety: C56 H112 Gd6 N8 O48 P8 2+,2(N1 O3 1-),40(H2 O1). From the CIF bond table, Gd1 (Gd) has 8 O neighbors; Gd2 (Gd) has 8 O neighbors; Gd3 (Gd) has 8 O neighbors; Gd4 (Gd) has 8 O neighbors; Gd5 (Gd) has 8 O neighbors; Gd6 (Gd) has 8 O neighbors. Oxygen-bridged metal-site graph: 4 pairs, 3 components; largest component is a network with cycles with approximately planar metal-site arrangement. Computed bridged metal-metal separations span 3.952-3.999 Å (not direct metal-metal bonds). Computed M-O-M angles span 111.62-113.15°; individual values and O labels are in metal_framework.links. Article card reports molecular formula R-[Gd6(pmhpH)8(NO3)2(H2O)8]·19H2O. Explicit grouped units in the article formula/name: 2 NO3 (explicit grouped unit in article formula), 8 H2O (explicit grouped unit in article formula).",
